<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show net fall in weekly reserves.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show net fall in weekly reserves.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Thursday show that net currency reserves fell to about 101.8 billion marks in the week ending March 23, from about 102.2 billion in the week ending March 15.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p>    Banking week ended		    March 23	March 15</p>
<p>    Gross currency reserves	     118.1	    118.4</p>
<p>    Foreign liabilities		    16.3	    16.2</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
